task_spec.prompt:
Refactor internal/products/products.go: replace the three package-level globals (store, nextID, mu) with a ProductStore struct.

Requirements:
  type ProductStore struct {
      mu     sync.Mutex
      items  []Product
      nextID int
  }

  func NewProductStore() *ProductStore — creates store with nextID=1

  Move all CRUD logic to (*ProductStore) methods:
    func (s *ProductStore) Reset()
    func (s *ProductStore) Handler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request)
    (and any internal helpers)

  Keep the existing package-level API working by wiring to a default instance:
    var defaultStore = NewProductStore()
    func ResetStore() { defaultStore.Reset() }
    func Handler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) { defaultStore.Handler(w, r) }

All 4 existing tests (TestListEmpty, TestCreateAndGet, TestGetNotFound, TestDelete) must still pass — they use the package-level Handler and ResetStore.
Run: go test ./...
